From: SoftBank Air5 Maintainer <dev@air5.example>
Date: Sun, 01 Jun 2025 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] watchdog: qcom: add IPQ807x compatible string

The IPQ8072A has the KPSS WDT at 0xB017000 with register layout
identical to "qcom,kpss-wdt". Add explicit compatible string so the
driver can match "qcom,kpss-wdt-ipq807x" from DTS.

Signed-off-by: SoftBank Air5 Maintainer <dev@air5.example>
---
 drivers/watchdog/qcom-wdt.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/watchdog/qcom-wdt.c b/drivers/watchdog/qcom-wdt.c
index 39b2dbd2b3a9..e485a8da2afc 100644
--- a/drivers/watchdog/qcom-wdt.c
+++ b/drivers/watchdog/qcom-wdt.c
@@ -261,6 +261,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id qcom_wdt_of_table[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,scss-timer", .data = &match_data_apcs_tmr },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,kpss-wdt", .data = &match_data_kpss },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,kpss-wdt-ipq807x", .data = &match_data_kpss },
 	{ },
 };
 MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(of, qcom_wdt_of_table);
